{"title": "Frightened Immunity", "pageid": 28245, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Frightened_Immunity", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Frightened Immunity</b> is a passive feature that keeps the wearer brave.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour\" title=\"Cerebral Citadel Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cerebral_Citadel_Armour\" title=\"Cerebral Citadel Armour\">Cerebral Citadel Armour</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>In addition to the Frightened condition, <b>Frightened Immunity</b> also prevents every condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a></span> status group.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \n